{"orgCode":"0984","name":"CalSavers Retirement Savings Board","agencyCode":"0010","agencyName":"Legislative, Judicial, and Executive","description":"The CalSavers Retirement Savings Board (Board) was established by Chapter 734, Statutes of 2012 (SB 1234). Chapter 804, Statutes of 2016 (SB 1234), subsequently authorized the Board to implement the CalSavers Retirement Savings Program (CalSavers), a state-administered retirement savings program for private sector employees in California with no access to workplace retirement savings plans. The Board's mission is to ensure all Californians have a path to financial security in retirement by providing a simple, portable, low-cost way for workers to invest in their futures.\n\nThe Board consists of nine members: the State Treasurer (Chairperson), the Director of the Department of Finance, the State Controller, a retirement savings and investment expert appointed by the Senate Committee on Rules, an employee representative appointed by the Speaker of the Assembly, a small business representative appointed by the Governor, a public member appointed by the Governor, and two additional members appointed by the Governor.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"positions":{"py":14.8,"cy":16,"by":16},"excluded":{"nongovernmental":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/0010/0984","kind":"department","name":"CalSavers Retirement Savings Board","code":"0984","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"positions":{"py":14.8,"cy":16,"by":16},"byFundType":{},"children":[],"sources":[{"label":"ebudget.ca.gov API: orgProgram/0984","url":"https://ebudget.ca.gov/api/budget/e/2026-27/orgProgram/0984"},{"label":"Detailed Expenditures by Program (PDF)","url":"https://ebudget.ca.gov/2026-27/pdf/Enacted/GovernorsBudget/0010/0984.pdf"}],"extra":{"legalCitations":"DEPARTMENT AUTHORITY\n\nGovernment Code Sections 100000-100050."},"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/0010/0984/0910","kind":"program","name":"CalSavers Retirement Savings Program","code":"0910","amounts":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653},"byFundType":{"nongovernmental":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653}},"positions":{"py":14.8,"cy":16,"by":16},"description":"0910 - CALSAVERS\n\nThe Program provides workers access to a simple, portable, low-cost retirement savings account. Any private sector employer with at least one employee that does not offer a workplace retirement savings vehicle by the statutory compliance deadline, or is otherwise exempted, is required to provide their employees with access to the Program. The final compliance deadline for employers with one to four employees is December 31, 2025. Compliance deadlines for employers with five or more employees have passed.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0984/0910/f8111","kind":"fund","name":"CalSavers Retirement Savings Trust Administration Fund","code":"8111","amounts":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653},"byFundType":{"nongovernmental":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653}},"extra":{"fundType":"nongovernmental","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653}}}}]}],"excluded":{"nongovernmental":{"py":4161,"cy":7649,"by":9653}}},"funding":{"id":"exp/0010/0984/funding","kind":"root","name":"CalSavers Retirement Savings Board: Funding by fund and appropriation","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0984/funding/general","kind":"fundType","name":"General Fund","code":"general","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0}},"children":[{"id":"exp/0010/0984/fund/0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","fundClass":"G","notInApi":true,"nonAdd":[{"label":"011 Budget Act appropriation (loan to CalSavers Retirement Savings Trust Administration Fund)","appropriationType":"State Operatio